  subtitles:
  - text: It didn't work. The breaker is smashed. They knew.
    duration: 6.5
  - text: They knew I was coming down here. They are smart.
    duration: 4.5
  - text: I can hear them on the stairs. They are blocking the way back to the office.
    duration: 6
  - text: "I\u2019m not gonna make it out tonight. I\u2019m sorry, Mom. I\u2019m
      so sorry."
    duration: 7
  - text: Wait... The emergency exit. In the main lobby.
    duration: 4.5
  - text: I left the last tape there. By the <b><color=yellow>Exit Door of the Storage
      Room</color></b>. If you find this... run. Just run!
    duration: 10.5
